enums script_kinds v1
description "Enums of an enums file named like builtins the TypeScript and JavaScript code reads"

enum thing(object) = plain | boxed
enum amount(number) = one | two
enum size(big_int) = small | large
enum reckoning(math) = add | subtract
enum fault(error) = fine | broken

prerequisites order over thing
  start plain
  boxed requires plain
